sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Operator
    participant API as Settlement API
    participant Service as Settlement application service
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Operator->>API: POST /settlement-previews (quote IDs)
    API->>Service: preview(actor, ordered quote IDs)
    Service->>DB: Read active quotes and Receivables
    DB-->>Service: Immutable calculation snapshots
    Service-->>Operator: Non-persisted total and validation result

    Operator->>API: POST /settlements + Idempotency-Key
    API->>Service: settle(actor, key, canonical request hash)
    Service->>DB: BEGIN
    Service->>DB: Insert PROCESSING idempotency record<br/>(unique actor, operation, key)
    alt existing key and same request hash
        DB-->>Service: Stored COMPLETED Settlement
        Service-->>Operator: Original response (idempotent replay)
    else existing key and different request hash
        DB-->>Service: Unique record with different hash
        Service-->>Operator: 409 idempotency conflict
    else first request
        Service->>DB: Revalidate quote expiry/status and Receivable versions
        Service->>DB: Transition Receivables and Quotes atomically
        Service->>DB: Insert Settlement, items, and audit event
        Service->>DB: Mark idempotency record COMPLETED with result ID
        alt every invariant succeeds
            Service->>DB: COMMIT
            Service-->>Operator: 201 immutable Settlement
        else conflict, expiry, or injected failure
            Service->>DB: ROLLBACK (including PROCESSING record)
            Service-->>Operator: Controlled 4xx/5xx problem response
        end
    end
